{
  "family": "collision",
  "description": "Identity overlap revealed only after ref resolution (Issue# 606 - tap, Codex; FHIR: 'if any resource identities, including resolved identities, overlap the transaction SHALL fail'): a ref that resolves to a row the same batch also addresses by explicit id, or names as a delete or purge target, is refused against the RESOLVED id — the addressing syntax can never turn one object into last-write-wins or create-then-delete. Three aliases on one key are refused whole-batch; a cross-batch resolution is sequential by design.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "a ref that resolves to a row this batch also addresses by id is refused, ref first (Issue# 606 - tap)",
      "tags": [],
      "covers": [
        "req-grid-entity-natural-key-13",
        "req-grid-import-grift-identity-3",
        "req-grid-import-grift-preflight-2"
      ],
      "grid": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "name": "A",
            "type": "panel",
            "props": {
              "name": "Home",
              "slug": "home",
              "description": "",
              "view": "tap_web/panel_error.html"
            }
          }
        ],
        "edges": []
      },
      "imports": [
        {
          "batches": [
            {
              "name": "b1",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "ref": "p",
                  "type": "panel",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "Home",
                    "slug": "home",
                    "description": "",
                    "view": "tap_web/panel_error.html"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "A",
                  "type": "panel",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "Home, by id",
                    "slug": "home",
                    "description": "",
                    "view": "tap_web/panel_error.html"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "imports": [
          {
            "success": false,
            "batches": {
              "b1": "failed"
            },
            "errors": [
              {
                "code": "duplicate_entity_id",
                "path": "$.batches[0].nodes[0].entity.ref"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "live": {
          "A": 1
        },
        "tombstoned": {},
        "absent": [
          "p"
        ],
        "events": {
          "A": {
            "update": 0
          }
        },
        "note": "Preflight saw two ids (the provisional and A's); after resolution both address A. The duplicate is judged against the resolved id: refused, nothing written, no last-write-wins."
      }
    },
